      "body": "Poddar Housing and Development Limited announced that Mr. Suman Kumar Verma and Ms. Meenakshi Saini, Independent Directors of the Company, have tendered their respective resignation letters dated September 27, 2025, intending to resign as Directors of the Company with immediate effect. Mr. Suman Kumar Verma holds directorships as Independent Director at Dentex (India) Limited, Vincent Commercial Co. Limited, and Nivaka Fashions Limited. Ms. Meenakshi Saini holds directorship as Independent Director at Dentex (India) Limited. Both directors cited personal reasons and preoccupation as the reasons for their resignation. The company acknowledged the receipt of the resignation letters and agreed to submit the necessary forms with the Registrar of Companies (ROC).",
